QueryMate Sync from GitHub(private) to GitLab(TUC Gitlab)
This project syncs the private GitHub repository Sanat0505/querymate (from https://github.com/Sanat0505/) to the GitLab repository of TU Chemnitz group11-Techblend.

Overview
The purpose of this project is to automate the synchronization of the code from a private GitHub repository (Sanat0505/querymate) to the GitLab group repository (group11-Techblend). This ensures that all updates are reflected on both platforms.

